---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../site.json';
---
<Layout title={'Privacy | '+site.title} description={'Privacy information for '+site.title}>
<div class="wrap content"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p>Reviewed: 30 October 2026. The initial static site code contains no accounts or comment forms. AdSense and affiliate advertising remain disabled until explicitly configured, site approval, updated privacy disclosures, and any required consent mechanism are in place.</p><h2>Hosting and external links</h2><p>Hosting infrastructure may process technical request information for delivery and security. Official resources linked from articles have their own privacy practices.</p><h2>Updates</h2><p>The notice must be reviewed and updated before advertising, analytics, cookie-dependent services, external embeds or forms are enabled. See the advertising disclosure for further details.</p></div></Layout>
